1
00:00:00,037 --> 00:00:02,497
(Leonard:)- Two hundred.
- Man, you're killing me.

2
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:08,040
(Stuart:)Two ten and I'm losing money.

3
00:00:08,212 --> 00:00:10,882
Oh, no, we can't let him lose money,
Leonard. I'm so sorry.

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:14,010
(Leonard:)Two ten and you throw in
the Iron Man helmet.

5
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,806
(Stuart:)Are you crazy? That helmet's
signed by Robert Downey, Jr.

6
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:18,051
(Leonard:)So?

7
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:21,266
If you're gonna question
the importance of a signature...

8
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:24,313
(Stuart:)...on a plastic helmet from a movie
based on a comic book...

9
00:00:24,478 --> 00:00:27,768
(Stuart:)...then all of our lives
have no meaning.

10
00:00:31,819 --> 00:00:36,739
- Okay, fine. Just the sword, 210.
- Thank you. I can eat meat this week.

11
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,620
I've long said that what you lack
in academic knowledge...

12
00:00:43,789 --> 00:00:46,169
(Sheldon:)...you make up for in street smarts.

13
00:00:46,333 --> 00:00:48,213
- You want me to wrap it?
- No, it's okay.

14
00:00:48,377 --> 00:00:51,217
(Leonard:)I'm gonna stab my friend in the chest.

15
00:00:52,298 --> 00:00:54,298
- Hey, Stuart.
- Ah, hey, Wil.

16
00:00:54,466 --> 00:00:56,846
(Sheldon:)Hello, Wil Wheaton.

17
00:00:59,013 --> 00:01:02,513
- Hi, Sheldon. Nice sword.
- It's part of my sword collection.

